WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.953
- I heard that you,

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:02.550
speaking of people just coming up to you,

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.000
I heard that one time you
were in an airport, was it?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.833
(Jay laughing)

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:08.156
And a lady came up and slapped you.

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:08.989
- [Jay] Yeah, yeah.
- [Kelly] And, what?

00:00:10.318 --> 00:00:11.917
- She reached back to, like,
eighth grade and she was, like,

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:13.718
"Ramone, I got something for you."

00:00:13.718 --> 00:00:15.030
(Kelly and audience laughing)
(Jay growling)

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.497
- Your name was not Ramone.
(Jay and Kelly laughing)

00:00:17.497 --> 00:00:18.511
- No.
- Lies.

00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:19.770
- Lies.
- Lies.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:24.543
- Yeah, so I was at the
airport and I was going to get,

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.690
I was going to, like, get
some Advil or something from,

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.340
like, one of those little turnstiles and,

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.110
like, the magazine store.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.840
And there was a woman standing
on the other side of it,

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.940
and before I turn it, I'm like, "Hey."

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.500
And it's going to, like,
bump into her if I turn it.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.201
So, I'm like, "Hey, excuse
me, I just wanna turn this."

00:00:40.201 --> 00:00:42.570
She turns around and looks at
me, and her eyes, literally,

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:45.660
were like, this big and she reached back,

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.478
and it was so far, that I
could have probably dodged it.

00:00:48.478 --> 00:00:49.396
(audience member laughing)
- It was like slow-mo.

00:00:49.396 --> 00:00:51.180
- It was like, but it was also,

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.130
I couldn't believe what was happening,

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.750
and literally she, I mean,

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.410
you could hear her hand cut
through the wind, this...

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.701
(Jay imitating wind and slapping)

00:00:58.701 --> 00:00:59.584
(hand slaps)

00:00:59.584 --> 00:01:00.417
And like, slap across my face.

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:02.745
- Which is not okay.
- [Jay] At all.

00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:03.720
(audience laughing)
- No.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.790
- But she immediately went
to like, Macaulay Culkin,

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.590
and she was like, "Oh my god!"

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:08.737
Look, she started
screaming and she's like,

00:01:08.737 --> 00:01:10.530
"I'm so sorry, I didn't mean to do that,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.234
you remind me of my
ex-boyfriend, like he, we,

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:13.080
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.730
and you're like, Lawrence
is just like him.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.950
And like, seeing you was seeing
him, and like I'm just..."

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.484
And literally, it was this crazy moment.

00:01:19.484 --> 00:01:20.592
- Like ma'am.

00:01:20.592 --> 00:01:21.951
That's not okay!
(audience laughing)

00:01:21.951 --> 00:01:22.980
Well what am I supposed to say?

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:23.813
- [Kelly] That.

00:01:23.813 --> 00:01:25.270
- Lawrence is triggering,
you know, like...

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.190
- No. (laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.500
- What am I supposed to say?
- But that's a character.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.400
- Yes.
- Okay.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.290
- But for some people,
listen I always say...

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.497
- Like if somebody walked up and was like,

00:01:32.497 --> 00:01:34.236
"I hated 'Since You've Been Gone'."

00:01:34.236 --> 00:01:35.403
Like,
(Jay and audience laughing)

00:01:35.403 --> 00:01:38.400
like that's your problem ma'am, like what?

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.233
- That's true.

00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:41.504
- Yeah, that's weird. That's definitely...

00:01:41.504 --> 00:01:43.099
- But I wasn't gonna call
airport police on her.

00:01:43.099 --> 00:01:43.932
- Not acceptable.

00:01:43.932 --> 00:01:48.743
That's 'cause you're nice.
(Jay and audience laughing)

